<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref} from 'vue'
import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue'
import FormModal from '../components/common/FormModal.vue'
import {useDemoStore} from '../stores/demo'
import {download} from '../utils/download'
const store=useDemoStore(),confirmReset=ref(false)
const baseURL=import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE_URL||'/api'
function exportConfig(){download('robotic-lab-demo-config.json',JSON.stringify({mode:'MOCK',models:store.models,datasets:store.datasets,jobs:store.jobs.map(j=>({id:j.id,config:j.config})),checkpoints:store.checkpoints},null,2),'application/json');store.notify('已导出演示配置。')}
</script>
<template><PageHeading title="设置" description="调整工作空间体验，管理本地演示状态。"/><div class="settings-layout"><section class="panel"><h2>外观与模拟</h2><p>偏好仅保存在当前浏览器中。</p><div class="setting-row"><span>界面主题<small>浅色与深色模式</small></span><select :value="store.dark?'dark':'light'" aria-label="界面主题" @change="store.dark=($event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value==='dark'"><option value="light">浅色</option><option value="dark">深色</option></select></div><div class="setting-row"><span>模拟时钟<small>每 2 秒推进训练、日志和指标</small></span><button class="button" @click="store.live=!store.live">{{store.live?'暂停':'恢复'}}</button></div><div class="setting-row"><span>本地存储<small>任务状态、配置、Checkpoint 自动保存</small></span><span class="catalog-badge">自动保存</span></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>后端连接</h2><p>训练使用 Mock API；本地服务提供 GPU 检测、模型导入和数据集上传。</p><div class="setting-row"><span>API Base URL<small>通过 VITE_API_BASE_URL 配置后重新构建</small></span><code>{{baseURL}}</code></div><div class="info-note">真实 FastAPI 集成尚未启用。修改环境变量不会自动将演示模式切换为真实训练。</div></section><section class="panel"><h2>演示数据</h2><p>导出配置用于记录实验设计，或重置到初始演示状态。</p><div class="setting-row"><span>导出配置<small>JSON 文件，不包含模型权重</small></span><button class="button" @click="exportConfig">导出</button></div><div class="setting-row"><span>重置演示<small>清除新增模拟任务并恢复默认配置</small></span><button class="button danger" @click="confirmReset=true">重置</button></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>关于 Robotic Lab</h2><p>机器人模型训练管理平台 · 前端演示版</p><dl class="summary-list"><div><dt>版本</dt><dd>0.2.0 · 全页面预览</dd></div><div><dt>本地运行</dt><dd><code>npm run dev</code></dd></div><div><dt>生产构建</dt><dd><code>npm run build</code></dd></div><div><dt>演示数据边界</dt><dd>训练为 Mock；GPU 检测、模型导入和数据集上传为真实操作。</dd></div></dl></section></div><FormModal v-if="confirmReset" title="重置演示数据" @close="confirmReset=false"><div class="info-note">新增的模拟任务、登记数据集和模型配置修改将被清除。可先导出配置留存。</div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button" @click="confirmReset=false">取消</button><button class="button danger" @click="store.reset();con